le martingale N-A. The owner must reconcile the retained page-level scheduling edge; no mathematical premise is missing.\"}],\"consumer_checks\":[{\"id\":\"thm-finite-intensity-poisson-process-existence-and-mixed-binomial-law\",\"decision\":\"accept\",\"reason\":\"Its law-uniqueness argument uses finite total intensity, so Borel-set counts are finite almost surely. The repaired result covers its use, and its interface is unchanged.\"},{\"id\":\"poisson-and-cox-point-process-models\",\"decision\":\"escalate\",\"reason\":\"Owner reconciliation is required for the retained SME-30 scheduling edge; no assigned claim depends mathematically on that page.\"}]}"
